            "review_title": "Review at Turkuaz",
            "review_text": "Annemette V\nNha Trang, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nFrozen food\nNov 2019\nFirst of all, when i ordered food the cashier charged the wrong amount. Secondly, I ordered some food that included mashed potatoes and when it arrived, the middle was completely frozen. It was taken back, and just warmed some more which made the turkish meatballs that was on it completely dry. \nWould not recommend. Although i would recommend their turkish icecream stand that they have a little further down the food court.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 8, 2019\nTURKUAZ RESTAURANT\nDear guest, We apologize for this situation. We will improve our food service and educate our staff.\nWe hope that next time we do best service to you dear.\nRead more\nWritten November 10, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
