            "review_text": "Rogelio\nBig Spring, Texas2 contributions\n0\nthank you very much\nOct 2019\nhe villa was as gorgeous as the hospitality of Flavia, located in one of the world’s locations with a special vibe where the view is really awesome! A drink at night outside at the bar and an early morning swim before breakfast are highly recommended. Room was nice, clean and yippie! a great shower :-) I have been to many placed, but when you are heading to Rio, do not look any further and just book it and give Flavia my warm regards on arrival. Jan\n\n · There is nothing to comment about that could be improved. Just for people in a wheelchair it is needed to arrange help to get down the stairs outside.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 7, 2019",
